              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 4.10: Compass needle and a magnet with a piece of wood in between"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.676,
            0.441,
            0.866,
            0.501
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Repeat the first or second part of Activity 4.6."
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.675,
            0.503,
            0.869,
            0.754
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Without disturbing the bar magnet and magnetic compass, place a piece of wood between them, perpendicular to the table as shown in Fig. 4.10. Observe the compass needle carefully."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.755,
            0.884,
            0.814
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Is there any effect on the deflection of compass needle due to the piece of wood? Record your observation in Table 4.2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
